# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
SVGS = ['<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">SAKİN MİMİN (مْ) ÜÇ HÂLİ — GENEL ŞEMA</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="210" height="175" rx="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="127" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">1. İHFA-İ ŞEFEVÎ (م + ب)</text>\n  <text x="32" y="88" font-size="10.8" fill="#1e3a8a">• Harfi: Yalnız «ب» (Bâ)</text>\n  <text x="32" y="110" font-size="10.8" fill="#1e3a8a">• Kural: Sakin mimden (مْ)</text>\n  <text x="32" y="126" font-size="10.8" fill="#1e3a8a">  sonra «ب» harfi gelirse</text>\n  <text x="32" y="142" font-size="10.8" fill="#1e3a8a">  dudak ihfası yapılır.</text>\n  <text x="32" y="164" font-size="10.8" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">• Örnek: تَرْمِيهِمْ بِحِجَارَةٍ</text>\n  <text x="32" y="184" font-size="10.8" fill="#1e3a8a">• Gunneli ve hafif temasla</text>\n  <rect x="245" y="42" width="210" height="175" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="350" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">2. İDGAM-I MİSLEYN (م + م)</text>\n  <text x="255" y="88" font-size="10.8" fill="#14532d">• Harfi: Yalnız «م» (Mîm)</text>\n  <text x="255" y="110" font-size="10.8" fill="#14532d">• Kural: Sakin mimden (مْ)</text>\n  <text x="255" y="126" font-size="10.8" fill="#14532d">  sonra harekeli «م» gelirse</text>\n  <text x="255" y="142" font-size="10.8" fill="#14532d">  meal-gunne idgam olur.</text>\n  <text x="255" y="164" font-size="10.8" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">• Örnek: لَهُمْ مَا يَشَاءُونَ</text>\n  <text x="255" y="184" font-size="10.8" fill="#14532d">• 1,5 elif miktarı tutulur.</text>\n  <rect x="468" y="42" width="210" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fefce8" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="573" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#854d0e">3. İZHAR-I ŞEFEVÎ (م + 26 HARF)</text>\n  <text x="478" y="88" font-size="10.8" fill="#713f12">• Harfleri: «ب» ve «م» dışındaki</text>\n  <text x="478" y="106" font-size="10.8" fill="#713f12">  diğer 26 harfin tamamı</text>\n  <text x="478" y="126" font-size="10.8" fill="#713f12">• Kural: Sakin mim gunnesiz</text>\n  <text x="478" y="142" font-size="10.8" fill="#713f12">  ve tutulmadan açık okunur.</text>\n  <text x="478" y="164" font-size="10.8" font-weight="bold" fill="#854d0e">• Örnek: أَلَمْ تَرَ / هُمْ فِيهَا</text>\n  <text x="478" y="184" font-size="10.8" fill="#713f12">• «و» ve «ف» harfinde dikkat!</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">«م» harfi dudaklardan (şefe) çıktığı için bu kurallara \'Şefevî\' (Dudaksı) adı verilmiştir.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">İHFA-İ ŞEFEVÎ İLE İKLAB ARASINDAKİ TELAFFUZ BAĞLANTISI</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#faf5ff" stroke="#9333ea" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b21a8">İHFA-İ ŞEFEVÎ (DUDAK İHFASI)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• Formül: Sakin Mim (مْ) + Bâ (ب)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="110" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• Dudaklar birbirine aşırı bastırılmadan hafifçe</text>\n  <text x="35" y="128" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">  değdirilir ve genizden gunne sesi (1,5 elif) getirilir.</text>\n  <text x="35" y="150" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• Örnek 1: تَرْمِيهِمْ بِحِجَارَةٍ (Fîl suresi, 4. ayet)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="172" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• Örnek 2: وَمَا هُمْ بِمُؤْمِنِينَ / رَبُّهُمْ بِهِمْ</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fff7ed" stroke="#ea580c" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">İKLAB İLE KARŞILAŞTIRMASI</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• İklab Formülü: Tenvin veya Sakin Nun (نْ) + Bâ (ب)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="110" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• İklab\'da sakin nun önce sakin mime (مْ) çevrilir,</text>\n  <text x="370" y="128" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">  ardından tıpkı İhfa-i Şefevî gibi gunneli okunur.</text>\n  <text x="370" y="150" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• Örnek (İklab): مِنْ بَعْدِ (نْ + ب) → مِمْ بَعْدِ</text>\n  <text x="370" y="172" font-size="11.2" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">• Ayırt Etme: Kelimenin aslında «مْ» varsa İhfa-i Şefevî,</text>\n  <text x="370" y="188" font-size="11.2" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">  «نْ» veya tenvin varsa İklab kuralı vardır.</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">İhfa-i Şefevî her zaman iki ayrı kelime arasında gerçekleşir (birinci kelime مْ ile biter, ikincisi ب ile başlar).</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">İDGAM ÇEŞİTLERİ VE SAKİN MİMİN İDGAM-İZHAR UYGULAMALARI</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#ecfeff" stroke="#0891b2" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#155e75">İDGAM-I MİSLEYN MEAL-GUNNE VE BİLA-GUNNE</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11" fill="#164e63">• İdgam-ı Misleyn: Mahreç ve sıfatları aynı olan iki</text>\n  <text x="35" y="106" font-size="11" fill="#164e63">  özdeş harfin (birincisi sakin, ikincisi harekeli) birleşmesi.</text>\n  <text x="35" y="128" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#155e75">• 1) Meal-Gunne (Gunneli): مْ + م  ve  نْ + ن</text>\n  <text x="35" y="146" font-size="11" fill="#164e63">  Örnek: عَلَيْهِمْ مُؤْصَدَةٌ  /  كَمْ مِنْ فِئَةٍ  /  مِنْ نِعْمَةٍ</text>\n  <text x="35" y="168" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#155e75">• 2) Bila-Gunne (Gunnesiz): Diğer 26 harfin eşleşmesi</text>\n  <text x="35" y="184" font-size="11" fill="#164e63">  Örnek: اِضْرِبْ بِعَصَاكَ (بْ + ب) / قَدْ دَخَلُوا (دْ + د)</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">İZHAR-I ŞEFEVÎ VE DİĞER İDGAM TÜRLERİ</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11" fill="#14532d">• İzhar-ı Şefevî: مْ + (ب ve م hariç 26 harf)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="106" font-size="11" fill="#14532d">  Örnek: لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ / أَنْعَمْتَ عَلَيْهِمْ غَيْرِ</text>\n  <text x="370" y="128" font-size="11" fill="#14532d">• İdgam-ı Mütecaniseyn: Mahreci aynı, sıfatı farklı</text>\n  <text x="370" y="146" font-size="11" fill="#14532d">  harfler (ط-د-ت | ظ-ذ-ث | ب-م → يَا بُنَيَّ ارْكَبْ مَعَنَا)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="168" font-size="11" fill="#14532d">• İdgam-ı Mütekaribeyn: Mahreç ve sıfatı yakın harfler</text>\n  <text x="370" y="184" font-size="11" fill="#14532d">  (ل-ر ve ق-ك → قُلْ رَبِّ / أَلَمْ نَخْلُقْكُمْ)</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Sakin mimden sonra «و» veya «ف» geldiğinde dudak ortaklığı yüzünden ihfa yapmamaya çok dikkat edilir!</text>\n</svg>']

def uygula(v):
    for i, b in enumerate(v.get("bolumler", [])):
        if i < len(SVGS):
            b["gorsel"] = SVGS[i]
